<p>jab noujawaa'n pisar shah-e- dee'n se juda huwa<br />
roushan qamar sipahre baree'n se judaa huwa<br />
noor-e- nazar imam-e-mubee'n se judaa huwa<br />
laqt-e- jigar hussain-e- hasee'n se juda huwa</p>

<p>dil daagh hogaya dil-o- jaan-e- butool ka<br />
ghar be charaagh hogaya sibt-e- rasool ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>barchi se tukde hogaya laqt-e jigar ka dil<br />
qud baap ne chida huwa dekha pisar ka dil<br />
hota hai aabgina se naazuk bashar ka dil<br />
pathar ka dil nahi hai ye dil hai pidar ka dil</p>

<p>ayyoob bhi agar ho to dam bhar na kal pade<br />
aansu thame to mu se kaleja nikal pade<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>peeri me aafat-e ghame aulaad al amaa'n<br />
dil aur zaqm-e qanjar-e foulaad al amaa'n<br />
wo izteraab-e qaatir-e naashaad al amaa'n<br />
wo ashk-o souz aur wo faryaad al amaa'n</p>

<p>beta na ho to zeest ka phir kya mazaa raha<br />
jab ghar ujad gaya to zamane me kya raha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bichdaa wo laal jiska gawara na tha firaaq<br />
farmaate the ke loot liya tu ne aye iraaq<br />
aye mout jald aake bas ab zindagi hai shaaq<br />
qanjar ki aarzu hai shahadat ka ishtiyaaq</p>

<p>barbaad is tarha koi aabaad ghar na ho<br />
kya zindagi ka lutf jab apne pisar na ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaare na the hussain alaihis salaam ke<br />
laayi haram saraa me bahan haath thaam ke<br />
tharra rahe the paau'n shah-e tashna kaam ke<br />
sar dosh par tha zainab-e aali maqaam ke</p>

<p>farmaate the bahan ali akbar guzar gaye<br />
ham aise saqt jaa'n the ke ab tak na margaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pursaa tumhe shaheed ka dene ko aaye hai<br />
kis kis ke daagh aaj jigar par uthaaye hai<br />
peete hai qaak udaaye hai aansu bahaaye hai<br />
ye ham tumhaare laal ke qoo'n me nahaaye hai</p>

<p>sar tha hussain-e bekas-o tanha ki god me<br />
bete ki jaan nikli hai baba ki god me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sun ke bibiyo ke jigar par churi chali<br />
zainab zamee'n pa gir ke pukaari ke ya ali<br />
sirr-e qafi jahaa'n ke hai sab aap par jali<br />
jaata hai sarkasho'n me ye kounain ka wali</p>

<p>bekas ko aasra hai pisar ka na bhaai ka<br />
baba yahi to waqt hai mushkil kushaayi ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ya mustafa bala me phasa hai tumhara laal<br />
ya shere zuljalaal dikhaao inhe jalaal<br />
ya fatima mai lut'ti hu'n bikhraao sar ke baal<br />
ya rab ulat de aaj ye sab arsae qitaal</p>

<p>phir kya kisi se kaam hai sab se juda rahu'n<br />
bhai ko apne leke mai jungle me jaa rahu'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekha ye kehke bali sakina ko yaas se<br />
lipti wo daud kar shahe gardoo hasaas se<br />
taaqat na thi kalaam ki har chand pyaas se<br />
boli wo tashnakaam shahe haq shinaas se</p>

<p>kya is bala ke ban me tahayya safar ka hai<br />
sadqe gayi bataao iraada kidhar ka hai</p>
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaya sheh ne sabr behan chahiye tumhe<br />
qaaleq ki yaad sirro alam chahiye tumhe<br />
lab par razaa-e haq ka suqan chaahiye tumhe<br />
jo maa ka tha chalan wo chalan chaahiye tumhe</p>

<p>ab aaqri bahan ye sawaari hamaari hai<br />
baad in buzurg waro'n ke baari hamaari hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaaya shah ne haa'n safar-e naa gazeer hai<br />
aao gale lago ke ye sohbat aqeer hai<br />
ab aarzu-e qurb-e qudaa-e qadeer hai<br />
tanha hai ham sipaah e muqaalif kaseer hai</p>

<p>tay ho ye marhala jo eyaanath qudaa kare<br />
jis ka na koi dost ho bibi wo kya kare<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jaana hai door shab ko jo aana na ho idhar<br />
zid karke royiyo na hame chahti ho gar<br />
pehle pahal hai aaj shab-e furqat-e- pidar<br />
so rahiyo maa ki chaati pa ghurbat se rakh ke sar</p>

<p>raahat ke din guzar gaye ye fasl aur hai<br />
ab yun basar karo ke yatimo'n ka dour hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nanhe se haath jod ke boli wo tashna kaam<br />
bathlaaiye mujhe ke yatimi hai kis ka naam<br />
aankho'n se qoo'n bahaake ye kahne lage imaam<br />
khul jaayega ye dard-o- alam tum pa taaba shaam</p>

<p>bibi na poocho kuch ye musibat azeem hai<br />
marjaye jis ka baap wo bachha yateem hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>